[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7689.35, "timestamp": "02:08:09", "text": "所以，我们现在所做的就是玩街机游戏了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7692.709, "timestamp": "02:08:12", "text": "模式。实际上，你得不到那种结果。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7694.109, "timestamp": "02:08:14", "text": "呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7696.55, "timestamp": "02:08:16", "text": "开头有一个透明圆圈，用于辅助"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7698.709, "timestamp": "02:08:18", "text": "你出去了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7701.229, "timestamp": "02:08:21", "text": "你什么也得不到。你得不到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7703.669, "timestamp": "02:08:23", "text": "除非靠近，否则要保持距离。在坦克里，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7705.27, "timestamp": "02:08:25", "text": "你绝对什么也得不到。在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7707.189, "timestamp": "02:08:27", "text": "飞机，你大概能看到它们一次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7709.669, "timestamp": "02:08:29", "text": "他们关系很亲密。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7712.47, "timestamp": "02:08:32", "text": "而且你的燃料有限。你的飞机是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7714.31, "timestamp": "02:08:34", "text": "因为飞行速度太慢，所以速度也慢得多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7719.91, "timestamp": "02:08:39", "text": "你必须更加小心谨慎。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7721.83, "timestamp": "02:08:41", "text": "人只有一次生命。在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7723.51, "timestamp": "02:08:43", "text": "飞机，你只有一次生命。在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7732.47, "timestamp": "02:08:52", "text": "生命。所以，你想玩坦克游戏？是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7737.91, "timestamp": "02:08:57", "text": "我得找找。好的。是的，我发现了"}]